# The runtime build context must contain ONLY the Dockerfiles. The orchicon
# binary is deliberately NOT baked into runtime images anymore — the daemon
# bind-mounts its own executable at container-create time — so a stale
# deploy/runtime/orchicon copy (left over from before that change) must
# never be shipped to the daemon as build context. Even if the file is
# recreated by an older flow, docker build will not send it.
orchicon
